From 4c17266fe0064f16dc1de08a2a9ef203b9b8ba56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 23:47:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] One UI main page: entries grouped like One UI

The main page lists the One UI entries instead of the KDE modules:
Connections (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, mobile network, hotspot, wired), Sounds and
vibration, Notifications, Display, Battery, Wallpaper and style, Home screen,
Security and privacy, Accounts, Apps, General management, About phone,
grouped into cards in the One UI order (oneui.js groups). An entry with one
module opens it, several open the entry page (OneUiGroupPage) with the
modules in cards, one card per KDE category. KDE categories are expanded to
their modules; entries without installed modules are hidden and unlisted
modules go to "Inne ustawienia". Modules open by plugin id on top of the
current page, so back returns to the entry page. Search is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
